{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"vhdl","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"VHDL","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for VHDL (.vhd .vhdl).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"vhdl","name":"VHDL","extensions":[".vhd",".vhdl"],"grammar":"grammars/vhdl.json","lineComment":"--"}],"snippets":[{"language":"VHDL","path":"snippets/vhdl.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/vhdl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\-\\\\-.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:configuration|architecture|disconnect|unaffected|attribute|component|postponed|procedure|transport|constant|function|generate|inertial|register|severity|variable|generic|guarded|library|linkage|literal|package|process|subtype|access|assert|buffer|downto|entity|impure|others|record|reject|report|return|select|shared|signal|after|alias|array|begin|block|elsif|group|inout|label|range|units|until|while|body|case|else|exit|file|loop|nand|next|null|open|port|pure|then|type|wait|when|with|xnor|abs|all|and|bus|end|for|map|mod|new|nor|not|out|rem|rol|ror|sla|sll|sra|srl|use|xor|if|in|is|of|on|or|to)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:std_logic_vector|bit_vector|std_ulogic|character|std_logic|positive|unsigned|boolean|integer|natural|string|signed|real|time|bit)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/vhdl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Entity\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ent\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"entity ${1:name} is\",\n      \"\\tport (\",\n      \"\\t\\t${2:clk} : in std_logic\",\n      \"\\t);\",\n      \"end entity ${1:name};\",\n      \"\",\n      \"architecture ${3:rtl} of ${1:name} is\",\n      \"begin\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end architecture ${3:rtl};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An entity and architecture\"\n  },\n  \"Process\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"proc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"process(${1:clk})\",\n      \"begin\",\n      \"\\tif rising_edge(${1:clk}) then\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\tend if;\",\n      \"end process;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A clocked process\"\n  },\n  \"Library\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lib\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"library ieee;\",\n      \"use ieee.std_logic_1164.all;\",\n      \"use ieee.numeric_std.all;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"IEEE library\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# VHDL\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for VHDL.\n\n## Files\n\n`.vhd`, `.vhdl`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `--`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `ent` | An entity and architecture |\n| `proc` | A clocked process |\n| `lib` | IEEE library |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}